WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.895
Triangulum, the third spiral.

00:02.623 --> 00:05.299
This photograph from Chile lines up with our sky.

00:05.796 --> 00:14.816
The Triangulum Galaxy, third largest in the group, is about 2.7 million light-years away, a less certain distance than Andromeda's.

00:15.487 --> 00:18.951
On a very dark night some people can see it without a telescope.
